[PE-STRING] Invoke-WebRequest -Uri|Remote payload download|high|Downloader
[PE-STRING] reg add ... autorun|Registry autorun modification|high|Persistence
[PE-STRING] schtasks /create /sc onlogon|Scheduled task persistence|high|Persistence
